{"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.5,"t":"1718867188","y":0.046511627815394085,"x":0.7716049391467531,"w":0.069958845774332645},{"w":0.057613169352213556,"c":1,"t":"Test 2","y":0.053779069624731557,"x":0.11728395020043644,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"y":0.095777015465227211,"w":0.68118982950846352,"x":0.15837542478918712,"h":0.018075984554942304,"t":"Kudla's team made six changes altogether. For instance, they tripled the size","c":1},{"x":0.16049382423316993,"y":0.11336866908524224,"h":0.015991796172268868,"w":0.68518519083658858,"c":1,"t":"of fruit by editing a gene called FRUIT WEIGHT, and increased the number of"},{"y":0.13074204923169741,"t":"tomatoes per truss by editing another called MULTIFLORA.","w":0.52674896240234381,"x":0.15843621829247634,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.16026224890089302,"h":0.018775091856472303,"t":"While the historical domestication of tomatoes reduced levels of the red pigment","w":0.70803512573242178,"x":0.16038939152174275},{"x":0.15843623272067087,"c":1,"t":"lycopene - thought to have potential health benefits - the team in Brazil managed","y":0.17873969357056851,"h":0.016027747672073156,"w":0.72222218831380214},{"w":0.73456792195638021,"y":0.19611307447003978,"t":"to boost it instead. The wild tomato has twice as much lycopene as cultivated ones;","c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.16049381643364502},{"x":0.16255144587540257,"y":0.21366279057714754,"w":0.46296295166015622,"c":1,"t":"the newly domesticated one has five times as much.","h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"t":"'They are quite tasty,' says Kudla. 'A little bit strong. And very aromatic.'","x":0.16049383275026363,"y":0.2441107184360789,"w":0.62962961832682296,"h":0.0175171886933847},{"w":0.72222223917643225,"x":0.16049381857840236,"y":0.2790697673223943,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"The team in China re-domesticated several strains of wild tomatoes with desirable","c":1},{"t":"traits lost in domesticated tomatoes. In this way they managed to create a strain","y":0.2950530037141873,"x":0.16049382140875007,"w":0.70370371500651041,"h":0.01454001966999896,"c":1},{"y":0.31242638384806709,"t":"resistant to a common disease called bacterial spot race, which can devastate","x":0.16049381513702088,"w":0.68930043538411456,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"w":0.72427983601888013,"h":0.016034596379148724,"x":0.15843621357260626,"y":0.32848837194677594,"c":1,"t":"yields. They also created another strain that is more salt tolerant - and has higher"},{"y":0.34298025905756324,"h":0.017596640772196137,"c":1,"t":"levels of vitamin C.","w":0.175419069925944,"x":0.15619601481886572},{"w":0.69135803222656245,"t":"Meanwhile, Joyce Van Eck at the Boyce Thompson Institute in New York state","y":0.37779740850417576,"x":0.15843621010899719,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1},{"y":0.39534883706325341,"h":0.016017476296396715,"t":"decided to use the same approach to domesticate the groundcherry or goldenberry","x":0.16049383395969413,"w":0.73251027425130211,"c":1},{"t":"(Physalis pruinosa) for the first time. This fruit looks similar to the closely related","h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.15843621639489033,"y":0.41133720915617378,"w":0.70576131184895829},{"c":1,"t":"Cape gooseberry (Physalis peruviana).","x":0.1604938333350909,"w":0.34773661295572911,"y":0.42873969376560739,"h":0.016027748233718775},{"w":0.71399175008138027,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.16049383675615861,"t":"Groundcherries are already sold to a limited extent in the US but they are hard to","y":0.46075581380670105},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.69958847045898431,"x":0.16049383051569407,"y":0.47819767428574633,"t":"produce because the plant has a sprawling growth habit and the small fruits fall","c":1},{"t":"off the branches when ripe. Van Eck's team has edited the plants to increase fruit","w":0.71604939778645837,"x":0.16049381952021974,"y":0.49411071846401189,"h":0.01472320376914027,"c":1},{"x":0.16043919618290811,"t":"size, make their growth more compact and to stop fruits dropping. 'There's potential","c":1,"w":0.73674708048502602,"h":0.017905570031335638,"y":0.50981106636722995},{"w":0.67304285685221354,"x":0.15832680173910896,"y":0.5249683433981599,"t":"for this to be a commercial crop,' says Van Eck. But she adds that taking the","c":1,"h":0.018819932522004312},{"t":"work further would be expensive because of the need to pay for a licence for the","x":0.16049383787183083,"y":0.54358068334245857,"c":1,"w":0.70781890869140629,"h":0.016012340046912987},{"y":0.56095406348282462,"w":0.43415639241536452,"t":"CRISPR technology and get regulatory approval.","h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.1604938201493484},{"y":0.59302325603206774,"c":1,"h":0.015988371257085632,"t":"This approach could boost the use of many obscure plants, says Jonathan Jones","x":0.16049384413067855,"w":0.71604934692382816},{"c":1,"t":"of the Sainsbury Lab in the UK. But it will be hard for new foods to grow so popular","x":0.16042203257619594,"y":0.60871576316665865,"w":0.73059519449869792,"h":0.01819800768920754},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"with farmers and consumers that they become new staple crops, he thinks.","c":1,"x":0.16049383616197949,"y":0.62779740851760113,"w":0.66255142211914064},{"x":0.16049382955450275,"w":0.70576131184895829,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"y":0.65988372078387314,"t":"The three teams already have their eye on other plants that could be 'catapulted"},{"w":0.69547322591145833,"t":"into the mainstream', including foxtail, oat-grass and cowpea. By choosing wild","x":0.16049383962349548,"c":1,"y":0.67726737344367216,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.16255143363424746,"y":0.69316843321386767,"c":1,"t":"plants that are drought or heat tolerant, says Gao, we could create crops that will","w":0.70987655639648417},{"w":0.29218106587727866,"y":0.71075581381608111,"x":0.15843621589794391,"t":"thrive even as the planet warms.","h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"t":"But Kudla didn't want to reveal which species were in his team's sights, because","w":0.70576131184895841,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.74263839811308552,"x":0.16255144272778418},{"y":0.75872093049064326,"x":0.16049384606023354,"h":0.016014051942858987,"c":1,"t":"CRISPR has made the process so easy. 'Any one with the right skills could go to","w":0.70987650553385417},{"w":0.18930040995279948,"c":1,"y":0.77470930204866817,"x":0.16049382931715309,"t":"their lab and do this.'","h":0.01598837238037687},{"y":0.86773255796252025,"w":0.026748971939086916,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"42","c":1,"x":0.11522633697284339},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.95314993796778535,"w":0.30612678527832038,"h":0.03375352650564889,"x":0.66991655033568553,"c":1}],"h":3395}